# SESSION-LOG-*.md anywhere in repo are personal daily logs — NOT committed (per 2026-10-12 + 2026-10-13)
#   留作本地个人记录;远程只看到 CODE-AUDIT / DESIGN-SOURCES / MERGE-WORKFLOW 等公共文档
#   历史日志已通过 git rm --cached 解除跟踪,文件本身保留在本地
#   取回:git log --oneline -- docs/SESSION-LOG-2026-09-29.md  →  git show <commit>:docs/SESSION-LOG-2026-09-29.md
#   注:**/ 模式覆盖 docs/、docs/_archive/、android/docs/ 等任何子目录
**/SESSION-LOG-*.md

# 一次性 / 临时工作笔记(per 2026-10-13 用户决定)—— 不入库,本地留作个人记录
#   远程公共文档保留:CODE-AUDIT-* / DESIGN-SOURCES / IMAGE-COORDINATE-VERIFICATION /
#   MERGE-PLAN-* / MERGE-WORKFLOW / ONBOARDING / README / TROUBLESHOOTING /
#   CHUANGDANG-REGRESSION-PLAYBOOK / PROJECT-CLEANUP-*
#   取回:git log --oneline -- docs/creation-demo-acceptance.md → git show <commit>:docs/creation-demo-acceptance.md
docs/SUMMARY-*.md
docs/REGRESSION-*.md
docs/acceptance-*.md
docs/creation-*.md
